sequenceDiagram
  participant E as Evaluator
  participant A as AuthorizationService
  participant R as ReservationRepository
  participant X as Existing named executor
  participant V as Verify/rollback
  E->>E: policy/history/Evidence/sandbox gates
  E-->>A: AUTO_EXECUTE decision
  A-->>E: single-use authorization
  E->>R: atomic reservation(idempotency key, lease)
  E->>X: execute outside DB transaction
  X-->>V: result
  V-->>E: verified/rollback result
  E->>R: owner-token conditional finalize
